  "body": "In https://github.com/w3c/media-source/issues/11#issuecomment-149198915 I suggest a change to the [resource selection algorithm](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#concept-media-load-resource) so that preload=\"none\" has no effect for MSE.\n\nIn essence, if an object URL is treated like the `srcObject` case, then the preload attribute will be ignored. Also, it seems generally desirable to minimize the differences between these cases, so that switching to `srcObject` will not result in other seemingly unrelated changes\n",
